Compile the GUI test helpers without sun.awt.AppContext.

JDK 27 removed sun.awt.AppContext, and Gui and Docking compile their test
helpers into the main jars, so the build stops there. On JDK 27 the
shared owner frame is an ordinary frame in Frame.getFrames(), and
JTextComponent keeps the focused component in a static field.

Upstream: not submitted (Ghidra supports building with JDK 21 only)
Applies-to: all environments

